WEBVTT

00:10:27.956 --> 00:10:30.834
we thank them for being our first leaders,

00:10:30.876 --> 00:10:33.045
caretakers and teachers.

00:10:34.254 --> 00:10:38.300
What if we asked how we could
support them in return?

00:10:38.342 --> 00:10:39.343
(Applause)

00:10:39.343 --> 00:10:40.552
Yeah.

00:10:40.594 --> 00:10:44.264
(Applause)

00:10:44.306 --> 00:10:46.809
What if we celebrated stay-at-home moms

00:10:46.850 --> 00:10:50.562
as the essential members
of our society that they are

00:10:50.562 --> 00:10:52.439
rather than belittling their role?

00:10:52.439 --> 00:10:57.569
(Applause)

00:10:57.569 --> 00:11:01.156
What if employers and colleagues
recognize mothering